    title: "next concept audit input: sweep for write-only fields, meta keys, knobs and functions (no production reader), and re-check every keep-with-trigger verdict for whether its trigger can fire"  # 2ce3
    status: todo_hard  # 2ce3
    priority: 3  # 2ce3
